---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Improved Navigation">
  <div style="padding: 2rem; max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1>Navigation Improvements ✨</h1>
    
    <div style="background: #E8F5E9; border-left: 4px solid #00695C; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 2rem 0;">
      <h3 style="color: #00695C; margin-top: 0;">✅ Changes Applied</h3>
      <ul style="color: #00695C; margin-bottom: 0;">
        <li><strong>Removed "Systems"</strong> from primary navigation</li>
        <li><strong>Renamed "Lessons"</strong> to "Learn" (more action-oriented)</li>
        <li><strong>Streamlined navigation</strong> for better focus</li>
        <li><strong>Moved Systems</strong> to footer Resources section</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>🧭 New Navigation Structure</h2>
    
    <div style="background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🏠</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600;">Home</div>
        </div>
        <div style="color: #ccc; font-size: 1.5rem;">→</div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🚀</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600;">Start Here</div>
        </div>
        <div style="color: #ccc; font-size: 1.5rem;">→</div>
        <div style="text-align: center; background: #E3F2FD; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px;">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">📚</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1976D2;">Learn</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #666;">New!</div>
        </div>
        <div style="color: #ccc; font-size: 1.5rem;">→</div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">⚙️</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600;">Setup</div>
        </div>
        <div style="color: #ccc; font-size: 1.5rem;">→</div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">ℹ️</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600;">About</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🎯 Why This Works Better</h2>
    
    <div style="display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      <div style="background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--retro-purple); margin-top: 0;">🧠 Cognitive Load Reduction</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-secondary);">5 main navigation items instead of 6 reduces decision paralysis and makes the interface cleaner.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--retro-purple); margin-top: 0;">🎯 Action-Oriented Language</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-secondary);">"Learn" tells users what they'll <em>do</em>, while "Lessons" describes what they'll <em>see</em>. Users prefer action verbs.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--retro-purple); margin-top: 0;">📍 Systems Still Accessible</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-secondary);">Systems moved to footer "Resources" section and can be accessed within the Learn section - no functionality lost!</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🔍 Where to Find Systems Now</h2>
    
    <div style="background: var(--bg-muted); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0;">
      <div style="display: grid; gap: 1rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 2rem; height: 2rem; background: var(--retro-cyan); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: bold;">1</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Footer → Resources → "All Systems"</strong><br>
            <span style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Complete systems overview page</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 2rem; height: 2rem; background: var(--retro-purple); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: bold;">2</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Footer → "Popular Systems"</strong><br>
            <span style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Quick links to C64, Spectrum, NES, Amiga</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 2rem; height: 2rem; background: var(--retro-amber); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: bold;">3</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Learn → "By System"</strong><br>
            <span style="color: var(--text-secondary);">System-organized lesson paths</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #FFF3E0; border-left: 4px solid #E65100; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 2rem 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #E65100;">
        <strong>Result:</strong> Cleaner navigation focused on user goals while maintaining full access to all content!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>